findOnlineHosts('wlan0').then((hosts) => {
  console.log(hosts);
});
```
This will scan the network interface `wlan0` and return a list of online hosts.

Please note that this is just an example implementation and you may need to adjust it to suit your specific requirements. Additionally, you may need to install the `arp-scanner` library and add it to your project's dependencies before using this code.

